    "note": "The cube resists distortion, which is part of its dignity. It grows by a rear ell and nothing else; stretching it into a rectangle turns it into a different and worse house."
  },
  "trades_away": "Compositional interest and any hierarchy between rooms — four quadrants of roughly equal size make a democratic and slightly monotonous plan. In exchange it is cheap to build, cheap to heat, and dignified at any scale.",
